<title>GERMANY: One killed in Frankfurt courtroom shooting.</title>
<headline>One killed in Frankfurt courtroom shooting.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least one person was killed and another was injured during a shooting incident in a Frankfurt courtroom on Friday morning, German police said.</p>
<p>Police said they had detained the person who fired the gun. No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
